OL,3,GNEWSA'It shows you there is hope':
OL,4,AFootball coach on anorexia recovery
OL,5,Ajourney
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor Jordan Caldwell, turning 30 meant
OL,8,Fmore than celebrating another birthday.
OL,10,FIt was the chance to stand in front of
OL,11,Fa camera, strike a bodybuilder post and
OL,12,Freflect on how far he had come after
OL,13,Falmost two decades of battling
OL,14,Fanorexia.
OL,16,FIt was also an age his parents feared
OL,17,Fhe would never reach.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
