OL,3,GNEWSA'It shows you there is hope':
OL,4,AFootball coach on anorexia recovery
OL,5,Ajourney
OL,6,
OL,7,FJordan, who has lived with an eating
OL,8,Fdisorder since he was 12, said the
OL,9,Fphotoshoot was the culmination of a
OL,10,Fdream he had held onto since a relapse
OL,11,Fin his teens.
